WEBVTT

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.210
The following program is intended for mature audiences
and contains

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:14.760
Adult Content, Graphic Language, Graphic Violence,
Brief Nudity. Viewer discretion is advised.

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:28.570
BLADE OF THE IMMORTAL

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:30.990
One, two, three

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:35.280
Undead tree

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:37.700
What truth

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:41.370
I'll come true

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:48.540
Wow

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:52.420
I see that bright light

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:58.800
This is all I have

00:00:59.510 --> 00:01:03.310
What did you say?
I know

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:07.860
What did you say?

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:13.530
Hone the blade lie around

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:20.370
Survive of vision
Death and pleasure are my future

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:24.580
I got lost
I was lost

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:28.330
Survive of vision

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:31.630
Unfinished heaven

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:35.380
Now fight to claim your wounds

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:39.140
Don't know why
Don't know why

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:43.930
Survive of vision

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:56.400
-I'll take two--
-Five please!

00:01:56.490 --> 00:01:58.320
Well, aren't we lively today, boy.

00:01:58.410 --> 00:02:00.660
All right. You can have them for 16 mon.

00:02:00.740 --> 00:02:03.160
-You sure are a swell guy!
-Hey.

00:02:04.160 --> 00:02:08.500
Is it really a big deal?
It's not like it'll run him out of business.

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:12.170
-How can you not know to bow your head--?
-Miss,

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:14.590
just hurry up and buy some.

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:27.270
If I let you fight over the last Tengu mask,
this would be resolved.

00:02:27.350 --> 00:02:30.980
But the mask may break amidst all that commotion.

00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:35.070
No matter who wins, you'd never get along again.

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:37.320
Don't you think that's a waste?

00:02:38.490 --> 00:02:41.120
If you don't want to lose anything...

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:47.290
Okay. Then this is yours, girlie.

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:48.210
There.

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:52.840
You'll make a fine man, boy.

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:58.050
Come on, you're making me look bad here.

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:01.970
Here. No charge. Special occasion.

00:03:02.050 --> 00:03:04.970
-I don't want it.
-Listen, you...

00:03:07.140 --> 00:03:08.600
Sir,

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:13.610
pardon me, could you lend me what you've got
on your hip for a moment?

00:03:13.690 --> 00:03:15.230
I'd really appreciate it.

00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:20.450
Thank you.

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:24.780
Watch this, boy.

00:03:39.970 --> 00:03:42.430
Well, how about that?

00:03:42.510 --> 00:03:43.340
That's weird.

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:47.640
I suppose a kid wouldn't understand.

00:03:59.940 --> 00:04:03.280
-That was impressive.
-Sorry to hold you up.

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:05.990
You done with that?

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:13.830
Sir, this has tasted its share of blood, hasn't it?

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:27.220
Dad!

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:29.770
Renzo.

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:34.900
Did you get the mochi?

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:37.900
Good, why don't we go make an offering
at the cemetery?

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:42.110
Sir, you can take one of whichever you like.

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:45.240
As a substitute for an introduction to me,
Araya Kawakami.

00:04:57.630 --> 00:05:01.760
"So long as my heart stirs," was it?

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:05.550
-What?
-Nothing, just remembering the words of a friend.

00:05:06.550 --> 00:05:12.930
"So long as my heart stirs, my vengeance will fly
on tireless wings."

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:15.350
The man was once a fellow student.

00:05:18.190 --> 00:05:19.060
Rin.

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:25.110
If that man one day starts a fire that singes you,

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:28.740
I would ask that you bear him no grudge.

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:33.410
Everything is the fault of my father and me.

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:39.790
If you bear that man a grudge, his descendants
will certainly come for your life.

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:42.380
I'm sorry.

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:44.920
I didn't mean to upset you.

00:05:46.300 --> 00:05:48.720
I just didn't understand very well.

00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:51.220
That's just fine. Besides,

00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:56.100
I think you'll be better off forgetting what I said.

00:05:57.810 --> 00:05:59.770
It's Father!

00:06:00.980 --> 00:06:04.030
Father. She didn't need that much candy.

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:06.570
You're too sharp, Takayoshi.

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:09.070
-Did you say thank you?
-Yeah.

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:12.870
Well, then, why don't we go and give an offering?

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:19.880
What was your wish?

00:06:21.090 --> 00:06:23.750
That no one singes us with a fire.

00:06:25.420 --> 00:06:28.550
-And yours, Mother?
-Mine? Mine was...

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:32.810
Mom. Mother.

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:36.730
The man I found yesterday...

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:43.730
You punk, you can't even apologize?

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:48.360
You broke my sandal strap, Sir Makiyuri,
and offered not one apology?

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:50.450
It only broke when you kicked that bamboo.

00:06:50.530 --> 00:06:52.280
-You giving me lip?
-Stop it!

00:06:53.530 --> 00:06:54.950
Who are you?

00:06:56.910 --> 00:06:59.750
It's because so many are like you...

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:01.170
That man...

00:07:09.930 --> 00:07:14.720
Kind sir, this boy is part of my family.

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:17.600
I know not what wrong he has done you,

00:07:17.680 --> 00:07:20.310
but I beg you, please overlook his rudeness

00:07:20.390 --> 00:07:23.520
as merely the folly of youth.

00:07:24.480 --> 00:07:27.190
You know it pretty well for a city girl.

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:29.490
Etiquette, I mean.

00:07:29.570 --> 00:07:32.990
I may not look it, but I am the heir to a dojo.

00:07:34.030 --> 00:07:36.410
-Where?
-Honjo.

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:39.660
The birthplace of the Muten Ichi-ryu,
the Asano Dojo.

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:46.920
You mean the Asanos that died due to one
of their predecessor's quarrels?

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:49.550
So what, now you're homeless?

00:07:49.630 --> 00:07:51.930
How pitiful!

00:07:53.510 --> 00:07:54.510
Don't speak.

00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:58.100
You're going to make it right, aren't you?
Start with this.

00:07:59.430 --> 00:08:00.430
Fix it.

00:08:00.520 --> 00:08:02.270
-Forget that--
-Yes.

00:08:02.350 --> 00:08:03.980
Lady!

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:07.900
I can't be getting dirty, can I?

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:25.960
-Whoa, oops.
-Sir!

00:08:28.170 --> 00:08:29.340
It's done.

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:35.640
Somehow it feels better than before it broke.

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:37.300
I'm honored.

00:08:37.390 --> 00:08:42.600
Hey, kid. You should take a lesson from this
upstanding swordsman girl.

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:48.230
Why don't you tell him off?

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:52.650
I mean... I am glad that you saved me...

00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:58.780
If I provoked him,
you would've been killed along with me.

00:08:59.910 --> 00:09:03.160
So I just had to stay calm.

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:07.920
Since I've been thinking about only my parents
since this morning.

00:09:12.460 --> 00:09:14.380
Were your parents killed?

00:09:16.010 --> 00:09:18.100
By people from the Itto-ryu.

00:09:20.430 --> 00:09:22.720
So, what's the Itto-ryu?

00:09:23.730 --> 00:09:27.400
What do you mean "what"? There's no way
you don't know of them.

00:09:29.940 --> 00:09:32.110
-You really don't?
-Nope.

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:40.700
-So listen, your father--
-Oh, yeah, miss, are you free right now?

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:46.210
What is she doing without even a sword?

00:09:46.290 --> 00:09:48.210
After the dawn, in the disguise of the devil.

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:49.290
Good grief.

00:09:51.590 --> 00:09:54.670
Hurry up, Father, she's been waiting.

00:09:54.800 --> 00:09:57.180
I told you, I'm coming.

00:09:59.010 --> 00:10:01.970
Hello, sorry for making you wait.

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:11.110
You rarely serve out tea for our guests. Who
would've thought you would even have treats ready.

00:10:11.190 --> 00:10:16.570
We only have drunken guests anyway.
I'll handle things down here,

00:10:16.650 --> 00:10:18.360
don't be crass with her.

00:10:19.740 --> 00:10:21.410
Pardon his rudeness.

00:10:21.490 --> 00:10:22.870
It's all right.

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:26.540
Believe it or not, this room is the cleanest.

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:31.670
This is where everything we sell is made,
so please bear with it.

00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:37.090
Renzo told me... You were just at yesterday's fair,
and you're working the very next day?

00:10:37.170 --> 00:10:39.890
I don't think it's such a big deal.

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:45.520
Besides, if a kid grows up seeing a parent
who won't work, he'll turn out rotten.

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:47.270
I see.

00:10:47.350 --> 00:10:51.440
Anyhow, I'm indebted to you for today.

00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:56.900
If I had been there,
no shame would have befallen you.

00:10:57.990 --> 00:11:01.490
This may surprise you, but I used to wield a sword.

00:11:01.570 --> 00:11:08.040
I ran amok with some compatriots,
which motivated my wife to take our child and disappear.

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:12.500
But my wife died of an illness, and only Renzo returned.

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:15.380
So I can't help but feel a little off.

00:11:15.460 --> 00:11:19.840
A parent should accept that their child
may eventually walk a path similar to their own.

00:11:21.430 --> 00:11:25.970
Once the next job is done, I think we'll
be well fed from all of these.

00:11:28.850 --> 00:11:30.940
Are your parents in good health?

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:35.860
Actually, my parents were killed.

00:11:35.940 --> 00:11:39.360
How terrible. My condolences.

00:11:39.440 --> 00:11:40.400
It's all right.

00:11:41.490 --> 00:11:43.950
Would you listen to my story?

00:11:44.030 --> 00:11:46.080
If you'll share it.

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:47.830
Thank you.

00:11:47.910 --> 00:11:49.540
Even now, the events of that day...

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:50.960
Darling!

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:53.670
Darling...

00:11:54.580 --> 00:11:58.630
Ganging up on him...
Is this how a samurai should fight?

00:11:58.710 --> 00:12:03.300
Don't get confused. Your husband was too weak.

00:12:03.390 --> 00:12:04.680
More importantly...

00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:08.060
Woman. Take your own life.

00:12:08.140 --> 00:12:09.600
What do you think you're doing?

00:12:09.680 --> 00:12:11.770
Either way, your body isn't going to make it.

00:12:11.850 --> 00:12:15.110
But no man would touch a dead woman.

00:12:17.150 --> 00:12:21.950
Magatsu, we wouldn't be here if not for the perks.

00:12:22.030 --> 00:12:24.910
You can have your fun with the Tatsumi.

00:12:24.990 --> 00:12:27.280
Sleeping with a man's wife in a place like this...

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:30.750
Dumb kid. It's the situation that makes it great.

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:32.910
You filth.

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:35.750
Stuff like that is probably why your wife ran away.

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:41.420
Nothing beats a lamenting woman.
Are you impotent, or maybe gay?

00:12:44.180 --> 00:12:45.890
I'll be leaving.

00:12:47.470 --> 00:12:48.510
Guys.

00:12:50.930 --> 00:12:54.690
No. No. My daughter... Please!

00:13:22.090 --> 00:13:25.010
Okay. That should do it.

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:26.430
Break her.

00:13:28.640 --> 00:13:31.560
Close your eyes, cover your ears.

00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:36.980
What's about to happen now
would be too much for you to bear.

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:47.280
What's wrong, miss?

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:50.240
-Hey, Father!
-It's okay!

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:55.580
Your father just looks a little like my father.

00:13:55.660 --> 00:13:58.170
-I was reminiscing.
-I see.

00:13:59.170 --> 00:14:01.040
Here, I brought refills.

00:14:01.130 --> 00:14:02.170
Renzo,

00:14:03.300 --> 00:14:05.420
do you love your father?

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:10.390
That's a strange thing to ask in front of him.

00:14:10.470 --> 00:14:11.470
You're right.

00:14:11.560 --> 00:14:16.640
Renzo, could you go buy some tea from
Funamori Shop in Daimonyoko, please?

00:14:17.640 --> 00:14:18.900
Why all the way out there--?

00:14:18.980 --> 00:14:23.440
We have an important guest.
It's good manners to welcome them with good tea.

00:14:24.480 --> 00:14:25.860
I understand.

00:14:27.400 --> 00:14:29.820
I'm grateful for your sympathy.

00:14:30.950 --> 00:14:34.410
I have not come to kill you.

00:14:34.490 --> 00:14:38.750
That's a rather strange statement. Are you saying
you'll forget that night?

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:41.500
You think I could ever forget?

00:14:41.590 --> 00:14:46.340
I'll never forgive you people for showing my
father and mother hell on Earth.

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:48.550
So what will you do other than kill me?

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:54.220
If you were how you were back then,
I would have killed you yesterday. But...

00:14:54.310 --> 00:14:58.890
right now you're Renzo's only relative.

00:14:58.980 --> 00:15:03.400
Renzo is living unaware of your past,
believing that you're a normal person.

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:06.740
I've never heard such a selfish story.

00:15:06.820 --> 00:15:12.320
But if I kill you, I'm sure Renzo will walk the same path
I am now.

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:14.490
There's nothing sadder than that.

00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:20.670
Loathing, being loathed, killing...
I'm tired of it all.

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:26.380
Don't make any sudden moves.
My dagger would be drawn quicker.

00:15:29.130 --> 00:15:35.060
I just wanted to relay this feeling to you,
now that you're a parent.

00:15:35.140 --> 00:15:40.060
And you have to apologize to my mother.
From the bottom of your heart.

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:41.390
That's all.

00:15:45.610 --> 00:15:47.530
How cheap.

00:15:47.610 --> 00:15:51.150
Your parents' virtues and lives.

00:15:51.240 --> 00:15:54.820
Would you forgive me if I just apologize
and bow down to you?

00:15:54.910 --> 00:16:00.080
Of course not. Only a human life is worth a human life.

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:02.580
All because you're scared to get your hands bloody?

00:16:03.630 --> 00:16:08.920
Did I ask about any of that? Bow before me this instant.
Or was is it?

00:16:09.010 --> 00:16:12.340
A swordsman is someone who can do nothing
without a sword?

00:16:15.930 --> 00:16:17.100
Understood.

00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:22.140
For the various injustices inflicted upon your mother
two years ago,

00:16:22.230 --> 00:16:25.730
representing all involved, I...

00:16:32.450 --> 00:16:36.780
You can't do anything without drawing your sword.
That makes you a swordsman.

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:40.870
I sure was a dirty little hooligan.

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:44.830
But I can't let him learn of the real me.

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:50.510
Honestly... I'm sorry that my son met you.

00:16:50.590 --> 00:16:54.430
This is the one mask I can't ever take off.

00:17:00.180 --> 00:17:02.020
Maybe more like this?

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:08.270
Sorry.

00:17:09.320 --> 00:17:10.690
Don't think badly of me.

00:17:24.960 --> 00:17:28.590
So you went to see the guy from the fair.

00:17:28.670 --> 00:17:32.460
Departure makeup? It's well done.

00:17:32.550 --> 00:17:36.760
I like that sense of yours. Surprisingly.

00:17:36.840 --> 00:17:38.390
Thank you.

00:17:38.470 --> 00:17:42.810
Hey, so you've got a kid, and a skill that makes money.

00:17:42.890 --> 00:17:48.650
And you'd still steal everything from a girl with nothing?

00:17:48.730 --> 00:17:51.440
For what reason do you carry a sword?

00:17:52.650 --> 00:17:54.690
If you've been wronged, you can endure it,

00:17:54.780 --> 00:17:58.530
but when it involves someone dear to you,
it's different.

00:17:58.620 --> 00:18:02.410
In times like those, there's no holding back
for your opponent's sake.

00:18:02.490 --> 00:18:09.130
Anyone whose conscience that bothers
cannot speak of proper revenge.

00:18:09.210 --> 00:18:11.420
Yeah, you're right.

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:14.420
Exactly right.

00:18:31.690 --> 00:18:33.980
You almost just hit the girl.

00:18:35.990 --> 00:18:38.820
This is how you fight, isn't it?

00:18:38.910 --> 00:18:42.450
Are you that scared of harming the girl, mister?

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:48.210
You're straight idiots. Both you and the girl.

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:53.800
Sorry, Mr. Manji. I've got no time.

00:18:59.630 --> 00:19:01.390
Die.

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:02.640
Mr. Manji!

00:19:04.470 --> 00:19:06.270
-You!
-Fool!

00:19:09.770 --> 00:19:11.440
You're a hardy one.

00:19:15.070 --> 00:19:16.440
That was close...

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:21.450
Mister. Now it's over.

00:19:21.530 --> 00:19:22.490
Mr. Manji!

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:34.840
What...?

00:19:36.130 --> 00:19:40.340
Tough luck. That was the one I used getting in here.

00:19:40.430 --> 00:19:42.840
I'd forgotten about it until just now.

00:19:46.850 --> 00:19:50.140
So that's how you come at me. Girl.

00:19:53.350 --> 00:19:58.610
Do it. This is your fight. Finish it without looking back.

00:19:58.690 --> 00:20:01.950
I didn't...come here to...

00:20:04.700 --> 00:20:07.330
Mr. Manji, you can do it then.

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:12.420
I can't face my son again. Please.

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:18.960
No, Mr. Manji! I don't care if you call me a lowlife

00:20:19.050 --> 00:20:22.510
who won't get her hands dirty, just please stop!

00:20:22.590 --> 00:20:25.680
This is just like that night!

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:44.910
Hey, kid.

00:20:46.120 --> 00:20:48.950
What a small world it is.

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:52.500
A strange girl kept flapping her gums,
which dragged it out, but...

00:20:54.370 --> 00:20:56.630
As you've already seen.

00:20:56.710 --> 00:21:01.210
Rest easy, I'll reunite you with your dad right away.

00:21:09.970 --> 00:21:14.940
Who in the world are you? Curse you! You...

00:21:25.320 --> 00:21:28.780
Hey, Mr. Manji. Does a person's resentment

00:21:29.950 --> 00:21:33.120
not end until someone dies like this?

00:21:36.170 --> 00:21:37.830
You idiot.

00:21:45.510 --> 00:21:47.760
Did you make that grave?

00:21:50.890 --> 00:21:54.640
Miss. I'm leaving home tomorrow.

00:21:56.190 --> 00:22:00.690
Three days ago, when I returned to the room to move
Father's body,

00:22:00.770 --> 00:22:03.570
it was gone. That other man's body.

00:22:04.610 --> 00:22:07.490
He's alive somewhere. So...

00:22:11.660 --> 00:22:14.540
You understand, right? I know you do, miss.

00:22:19.830 --> 00:22:21.630
That man is dead.

00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:24.130
I buried him.

00:22:29.010 --> 00:22:31.680
I don't know how to put this,

00:22:31.760 --> 00:22:35.600
but I doubt there's a parent alive
who tells their children everything.

00:22:35.680 --> 00:22:39.980
As a child, not knowing why or anything else

00:22:40.060 --> 00:22:45.150
lets you live without resentment.
You have no idea how blissful that is.

00:22:45.230 --> 00:22:46.650
Darn it!

00:22:50.910 --> 00:22:52.200
Father...

00:23:11.140 --> 00:23:12.050
Shall we?

00:23:12.140 --> 00:23:13.550
Yes.

00:23:49.470 --> 00:23:52.470
ACT SIX - WING ROOTS
